  "description": "A comprehensive .NET library for managing application configuration with support for type-safe settings, directory entries, and network drive mappings. ConfigManager simplifies reading and writing app.config values, handling directories with exclusion paths, and maintaining drive mappings with integrated logging via RunLog.",
  "id": "AaTurpin.ConfigManager",
